ical hyperbola centered at the origin is\n\n$$\n\\frac{{y}^{2}}{{a}^{2}}-\\frac{{x}^{2}}{{b}^{2}}=1.\n$$\n\nFor a vertical hyperbola centered at the origin, the equations of the asymptotes are\n\n$$\ny=\\pm \\frac{a}{b}x.\n$$\n\nIn our case, we have \n\n$$\na=\\sqrt{36}=6,\\,b=\\sqrt{4}=2.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the asymptotes of the hyperbola are \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y & =\\pm \\frac{6}{2}x \\\\  & =\\pm 3x.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14053302/state.json" "file_sha256" "fca551999182ae333663420d91dc543dd930ece33ac0822929585890a6c50f30"} {"question" "q-316506" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14053302/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "60aeffb4230af503f600c2fcc10b85051688f94a5758300b6b5620fe9231f141"} {"question" "q-316506" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14053302/state.json" "file_sha256" "fca551999182ae333663420d91dc543dd930ece33ac0822929585890a6c50f30"} {"question" "q-316506" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "3x"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14053302/state.json" "file_sha256" "fca551999182ae333663420d91dc543dd930ece33ac0822929585890a6c50f30"} {"question" "q-116557" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Find the asymptotes of the hyperbola $\\frac{{y}^{2}}{18}-\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}=1.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14053302/state.json" "file_sha256" "fca551999182ae333663420d91dc543dd930ece33ac0822929585890a6c50f30"} {"question" "q-116557" "f